# LiteRT prebuilt .so + headers -- fetched fresh by
# native-bringup/fetch-litert.sh, same ephemeral treatment as
# micropython_embed/ above (regenerated by a script, not checked in).
# Unlike micropython_embed/ this is the project's first PREBUILT BINARY
# dependency (see NOTICE.md), not something compiled from vendored
# source -- fetch-litert.sh downloads the exact upstream .aar/.so
# rather than building it.
app/src/main/cpp/litert/

# libLiteRtClGlAccelerator.so, staged here by fetch-litert.sh (AGP scans
# jniLibs/<abi>/ by convention) -- same ephemeral/regenerated-by-script
# treatment as app/src/main/cpp/litert/ above.
app/src/main/jniLibs/

# Machine-specific (contains a local absolute SDK path)
